  "description": "Payment processing module for Tnzi.NET framework: charging, refunds, stored payment methods, callbacks and reconciliation, with the offline (manually confirmed) channel built in. The Stripe and PayPal channels ship separately in Tnzi.Payment.Stripe and Tnzi.Payment.PayPal, issuing invoices ships separately in Tnzi.Payment.Billing, recurring billing ships separately in Tnzi.Payment.Subscriptions, and discounting (promotions, coupons, redemption codes) ships separately in Tnzi.Payment.Promotions - so neither vendor SDK nor the PDF rendering, file storage and notification stack is in this package's dependency closure.",
